Error [E0741]: this `#Caps` region uses the effect `FS, IO`, which it doesn't allow
  --> tests/ui/effect_caps_out_of_set.jet:4:10
    |
  4 |     #Caps(Net) {
    |          ^^^^^
 Why: `#Caps(…)` restricts the region to `Net`; an effect reached inside — even through a call — must be in that list
 Fix: add `FS, IO` to the `#Caps(…)` list, or move that work outside the region
